-*   `TraceResult`: Contains `hit` (bool), `t` (float, distance), `cell` (integer 3-tuple), `normal` (float 3-tuple) [S1, unofficial].
-*   `BlockType`: Enum including `BLOCK_EMISSIVE` [S1, unofficial].
